---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const breadcrumbList = [{"name": "Home", "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/"}, {"name": "Ambassador & Endorsement Disclosure", "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/affiliate-disclosure/"}];
---

<Layout
  title="Ambassador & Endorsement Disclosure"
  description="How True Joy Birthing handles endorsements, ambassador relationships, and third-party links — including FTC compliance under 16 CFR Part 255."
  canonical="https://truejoybirthing.com/affiliate-disclosure/"
  breadcrumbList={breadcrumbList}
  schema={{
    "@graph": [{
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Ambassador & Endorsement Disclosure",
      "description": "How True Joy Birthing handles endorsements, ambassador relationships, and third-party links — including FTC compliance under 16 CFR Part 255.",
      "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/affiliate-disclosure"
    }]
  }}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-tjb-cream pt-16 pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Ambassador &amp; Endorsement Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-tjb-gray">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-8">

      <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">True Joy Birthing, operated by Agentic Trust, believes in transparency. This page explains our financial relationships with ambassadors and third parties, our approach to endorsements and testimonials, and our commitment to FTC compliance. We operate a Doula Ambassador Program that you can learn more about on our <a href="/ambassador/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors">Ambassador Program page</a>.</p>

      <!-- 1. Our Ambassador Program & Financial Relationships -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-cream-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">1. Our Ambassador Program &amp; Financial Relationships</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">True Joy Birthing operates a Doula Ambassador Program. Ambassadors are certified birth professionals — doulas, midwives, childbirth educators, and lactation consultants — who may receive benefits such as free Pro Mode access, featured placement on our city pages, cross-promotion, a partner badge, and early access to new features in connection with their participation in the program.</p>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">Ambassadors are independent community partners, not employees of True Joy Birthing or Agentic Trust. Ambassadors do not have authority to bind True Joy Birthing to any obligation, and their views and opinions are their own.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. FTC Compliance -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">2. FTC Compliance</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We comply with the Federal Trade Commission's <strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Guides Concerning the Use of Endorsements and Testimonials in Advertising</strong> (16 CFR Part 255). Under these guidelines, any material connection between an endorser and the product or service being promoted must be clearly and conspicuously disclosed.</p>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">Ambassadors are expected to disclose their relationship with True Joy Birthing when promoting the brand, our app, our services, or any content related to us. This applies to blog posts, social media posts, videos, podcasts, emails, and any other form of endorsement.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Disclosure Requirements -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-rose-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-rose-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">3. Disclosure Requirements for Ambassadors</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mb-3">Disclosures must be:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-tjb-gray">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Clear</strong> — Written in plain language that ordinary consumers can understand.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Conspicuous</strong> — Placed where consumers are likely to see them, not buried in a footer or hidden behind a link.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Near the endorsement</strong> — Close to the claim or recommendation, not separated from it.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Unambiguous</strong> — Not buried in a string of hashtags or placed after a long block of text.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-4 bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-tjb-rose-200/50">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-tjb-charcoal mb-1">Example disclosure:</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-tjb-gray italic">"I am a True Joy Birthing Ambassador. I receive free Pro Mode access and other benefits as part of this program."</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">On social media, the disclosure should appear before any links or hashtags, and #ad or #sponsored alone is not sufficient when a more specific disclosure is practicable.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Our Own Endorsements & Testimonials -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">4. Our Own Endorsements &amp; Testimonials</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We may feature testimonials, reviews, and endorsements from users, ambassadors, and other birth professionals on our website, in our app, and in marketing materials. These reflect the genuine experiences and opinions of the individuals who provided them.</p>
        <div class="space-y-2 mt-3">
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">No material alteration.</strong> We do not materially alter the substance of reviews or testimonials. We may edit for length, clarity, or formatting, but we do not change the meaning or substance of what was said.</p>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">No compensation for reviews.</strong> We do not pay users to write positive reviews. If a reviewer has a material connection to us (for example, they are an ambassador), that connection will be disclosed.</p>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Right to remove.</strong> We reserve the right to remove testimonials that no longer reflect the customer's experience, that we cannot verify, or that we determine are no longer accurate or representative.</p>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Not typical results.</strong> Testimonials reflect individual experiences and are not a guarantee of results. Your experience with True Joy Birthing may differ.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Third-Party Links -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">5. Third-Party Links &amp; Affiliate Relationships</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Our website and app may contain links to third-party products, services, and websites. If we have a material connection to a third-party product we link to — such as an affiliate relationship, partnership, or financial arrangement — we will disclose that connection clearly and conspicuously near the link.</p>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or accessibility of third-party websites. Following a link to a third-party site is at your own risk.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Changes to This Disclosure -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">6. Changes to This Disclosure</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We may update this disclosure from time to time to reflect changes in our programs, partnerships, or legal requirements. We will post the updated version with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Contact -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">For questions about this disclosure, our ambassador program, or our endorsement practices, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@truejoybirthing.com" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors">support@truejoybirthing.com</a>.</p>
        <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-tjb-gray">
          <p>Agentic Trust</p>
          <p>217 6th Ave N STE 43363</p>
          <p>Nashville, TN 37219</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Related links -->
      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-tjb-lavender-200/50 text-center">
        <p class="text-tjb-gray mb-4">Related: <a href="/privacy/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors font-semibold">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors font-semibold">Terms of Use</a> · <a href="/ambassador/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors font-semibold">Ambassador Program</a></p>
        <a href="/" class="btn-primary">Back to Home →</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>